{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>כי, היוצאת</b> — a stative participle. Do not wonder about <b>בני יצאוני ואינם</b>, for its meaning is 'they went out from me,' or this word may be like the word שב, which in some places is stative and in other places active, and I needed to say so because of the word תשאיר, and the sense is: for how can the kingdom arise when none remain of the men of the rich — a tenth?!"], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:04.150992643Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}